From cd49a26b50fd474f7c7375dbec253b69095dc42a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FZ <2865713811@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:36:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ascend): port FlashStates hybrid state frontier
 checkpoints

Backport FutureMLS-Lab/vllm@3cfd432 (vLLM v0.33.0) to vLLM v0.32.0 for
Ascend 910B.

- add vllm/v1/core/hybrid_checkpoint: recovery units, frontier index,
  GreedyDual-Size eviction, prefill cost model, export planning
- wire scheduler, block pool, KV cache manager and config hooks for
  exact-end and decode-boundary recurrent state checkpoints
- add mamba_frontier_checkpoint, prefix_cache_eviction, prefill cost and
  leaf-last config flags
- add InputBatch.prefill_checkpoint_positions for MRV2
- Ascend: classify manager subclasses with isinstance (covers
  AscendCircularBufferManager) and skip the per-request KpoolTailManager
  indexer tail
- CUDA-only prefill export (FlashKDA/FlashInfer) and compact spec-state
  paths are intentionally not included
